{"id":"d1f0523155d31ff5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CTable.md","title":"CTable","display":"CTable","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CTable","parameters":["v","s"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CTable"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>v</span><span>s</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：经典命题。有序参数：<code>v</code>、<code>s</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CTable v s)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ CVal v)\n  (and\n    (@ FormsC s)\n    (and\n      (forall n\n        (forall t\n          (implies (and (@ Nat n) (@ PAtom n t)) (iff (in t s) (exists b (and (@ Num1 b) (@ App v n b)))))))\n      (and\n        (forall a (forall t (implies (and (@ FmC a) (@ PNeg a t)) (iff (in t s) (not (in a s))))))\n        (forall a\n          (forall b\n            (forall t\n              (implies (and (@ FmC a) (and (@ FmC b) (@ PImp a b t))) (iff (in t s) (implies (in a s) (in b s)))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"524a355b32bd98f2\" href=\"?note=524a355b32bd98f2\" title=\"ZFC_CVal\">CVal</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43d22035e7796b1d\" href=\"?note=43d22035e7796b1d\" title=\"ZFC_FmC\">FmC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c0c9a9379a527254\" href=\"?note=c0c9a9379a527254\" title=\"ZFC_FormsC\">FormsC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CTable v s)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CVal","status":"resolved","id":"524a355b32bd98f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CVal|CVal]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmC","status":"res